Grammar

    0 $accept: transformgraph "end file"

    1 transformgraph: kernellist activenode

    2 activenode: ACTIVE id SEMICOL

    3 kernellist: kernel kernellist
    4           | ε

    5 kernel: DTL id inputlistwrapper ASSIGN LCURLY program RCURLY

    6 inputlistwrapper: COLON inputlist
    7                 | ε

    8 inputlist: id COMMA inputlist
    9          | id

   10 program: constdecls forstatement

   11 constdecls: constdecls constdecl
   12           | constdecls metadatastreamdecl
   13           | ε

   14 metadatastreamdecl: METADATASTREAM LESS intlit COMMA intlit GREATER id SEMICOL

   15 constdecl: type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   16          | NOPT type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   17          | type id ASSIGN LCURLY intlist RCURLY SEMICOL

   18 intlist: intlit COMMA intlist
   19        | intlit
   20        | ε

   21 forstatement: FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY forstatement RCURLY
   22             | FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY innernest RCURLY

   23 outstatements: outstatements outstatement
   24              | outstatement

   25 innernest: outstatements
   26          | ifstatement
   27          | switchstatement

   28 ifstatement: IF LPAREN ISEVEN id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   29            | IF LPAREN id LESS id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   30            | IF LPAREN id LESSEQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   31            | IF LPAREN id GREATER id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   32            | IF LPAREN id GREATEREQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   33            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   34            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id OR ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   35            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id AND ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   36            | IF LPAREN PAD id id id id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY

   37 switchstatement: SWITCH LPAREN id RPAREN LCURLY casestatements RCURLY

   38 casestatements: casestatement casestatements
   39               | casestatement

   40 casestatement: CASE COLON outstatements

   41 outstatement: OUT ASSIGN expr SEMICOL

   42 type: INT

   43 expr: expr CROSS expr
   44     | expr LESS expr
   45     | expr STAR expr
   46     | expr MINUS expr
   47     | term

   48 unarystmt: loc POSTINC

   49 term: factor
   50     | LPAREN expr RPAREN

   51 factor: intlit
   52       | loc

   53 intlit: INTLITERAL

   54 loc: id
   55    | id LBRACKET id RBRACKET

   56 id: ID


